            <div xml:id="m-1849cdb2-1480-4ca8-8c01-ef513c8397a0">
              <lg xml:id="m-80b5f697-1f41-456f-b88d-ac4e1e116604">
                <l xml:id="m-61d026b1-b529-44ad-bc98-8bcd1619f012" facs="#m-f22e1e1b-13f5-4541-b1ee-c37139d0f8c9" label="text-like">Sth Sunday atter Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-0fcc61d8-a3d3-4801-84bb-d76fddf8fdf4" facs="#m-b85d4cc8-bd02-41dc-a915-feb2322f10f1" label="ambiguous">iois</l><l xml:id="m-a9ef75fd-b4bd-40c8-a4c2-b96bf617afa6" facs="#m-0ccdca64-f86c-4bb9-b255-499fb8b1005c" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 16.</l><l xml:id="m-0c042a23-0b88-49f4-a4b7-4195ff6ecfb0" facs="#m-ff72a11a-aaf0-469d-aef3-aed63135768b" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Dixit Jesus disci-[ debes dómino meo? At ille dixit:</l><l xml:id="m-b0bcda70-78eb-4c64-95ad-c25ecbcd2cf1" facs="#m-4bf8460a-2164-45eb-92be-c70ebfd8c343" label="lyrics-like">L pulis suis parábolam hanc: Ho- Centum cados ólei. Dixitque illi</l><l xml:id="m-9ed5d1a1-b0ac-4e77-8ce7-e3b1a900fb99" facs="#m-04853cc9-fff1-4e30-9b4c-5c3335152bfd" label="lyrics-like">mo quidam erat dives, qui habébat</l><l xml:id="m-0677a7c4-b64c-4752-9170-318408ac8efb" facs="#m-06893534-51ff-4a37-94f7-484fc4a56848" label="lyrics-like">Accipe cautiónem tuam: et sede</l><l xml:id="m-d14701f0-35f6-47c3-9fab-37fb40193064" facs="#m-86160ab5-1169-4325-8c4f-b02bd7fd0bbf" label="ambiguous">cito, scribe quinquaginta. Deinde</l><l xml:id="m-a4b7eb37-2932-45eb-a7a9-287cf76d10b5" facs="#m-c27547df-01f9-4a78-9748-bc4a11cd9255" label="lyrics-like">villicum: et hic diffamátus est apud</l><l xml:id="m-250fe9ef-caf7-460b-9ce5-b0d978ce44cb" facs="#m-c9bd4290-93b6-4b65-88a3-a006d75a128f" label="lyrics-like">illum, quasi dissipásset bona ipsius.</l><l xml:id="m-8a3e1400-3406-4457-a9b1-8f4e3ff39007" facs="#m-b0e63491-8324-4525-928b-0c6e62638635" label="lyrics-like">álii dixit: Tu vero quantum debes?</l><l xml:id="m-d4cf5528-9f7e-428a-b0d6-8968514fb663" facs="#m-9de06eb2-b363-4f46-9030-3de607115bde" label="lyrics-like">Et vocãvit illum, et ait illi: Quid</l><l xml:id="m-19d13730-8c80-4f65-a9da-fbe5556c1619" facs="#m-edf498c3-c615-4821-ac8a-d3b9eaab0059" label="lyrics-like">Qui ait: Centum coros trítici. Ait</l><l xml:id="m-dddf24c8-90fd-459e-8dd9-458ebf010539" facs="#m-4f7c45f9-caeb-4543-ba7e-c65c665b7734" label="lyrics-like">hoc áudio de te? redde ratiónem</l><l xml:id="m-51102de8-98fa-4eca-95c5-4d765a2aa81a" facs="#m-80b2fc39-779e-480b-a668-cd78eb1de395" label="ambiguous">illi : Accipe litteras tuas, et scribe</l><l xml:id="m-40b53323-2fcc-44fa-b9e4-ff99ed0cb4d5" facs="#m-f67772bc-d901-40f5-b38d-18d495bbb6da" label="lyrics-like">villicatiónis tuae: iam enim non</l><l xml:id="m-23fc5189-2b56-4c0f-821c-49251745a863" facs="#m-f738573c-7951-49fb-9bac-8eca5d97eea5" label="lyrics-like">octoginta. Et laudávit dóminus vil¬</l><l xml:id="m-7277ccb8-6736-46ac-a90c-ac0005258ddb" facs="#m-3be7888a-7cd2-416d-9a53-8999d1955407" label="lyrics-like">póteris villicáre. Ait autem villicus</l><l xml:id="m-f23b0b2c-3f39-4a87-93d1-dad660e0c44f" facs="#m-efd73519-b2ac-403a-8a83-dac153c1b7d3" label="lyrics-like">licum iniquitátis, quia prudénter</l><l xml:id="m-8442c96a-071a-4780-bd1b-51afc36c8b6e" facs="#m-7fb4a2eb-9931-4822-80df-aef936abe1a5" label="lyrics-like">intra se: Quid fáciam, quia dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-87c11e67-d377-4025-9fdd-b85ad2e7f9a1" facs="#m-436c39c0-9249-4730-855b-099a12f344c0" label="lyrics-like">fecísset: quia filii hujus saéculi pru¬</l><l xml:id="m-1d2adcb4-4f08-40bf-9e64-789bd857279f" facs="#m-6a6512ab-1be2-45b7-9bf7-18094bcdacef" label="lyrics-like">nus meus aü̃fert a me villicatiónem?</l><l xml:id="m-d9e6f5bb-87f4-4ecc-8bea-d824ae4d948b" facs="#m-c7b5bbca-69d7-4aa3-b52f-ccf41e2fc339" label="lyrics-like">dentióres filiis lucis in generatióne</l><l xml:id="m-b27cffa6-6ce0-4e19-a201-53cb2c398a0f" facs="#m-ed01a9d5-91f0-4b32-895e-112952f1b0cd" label="lyrics-like">fódere non váleo, mendicáre eru¬</l><l xml:id="m-3c898752-21f6-4036-bfdb-dda402885a34" facs="#m-6aff0191-7db1-482b-81a1-74e3dc7371f0" label="lyrics-like">sua sunt. Et ego vobis dico: fácite</l><l xml:id="m-fbb4408e-fd8f-4b14-8536-9cfe4f45e7e8" facs="#m-19f123dd-c89f-45cb-8a99-ea0f532a1876" label="lyrics-like">bésco. Scio quid fáciam, ut, cum</l><l xml:id="m-a2854897-80d7-446a-8b26-f6e9b7a43481" facs="#m-db7ad169-5ea9-4ae2-b340-0c04df6f3452" label="lyrics-like">vobis amícos de mammóna iniqui¬</l><l xml:id="m-065ffda4-2afb-486b-8782-3dd0406ae72a" facs="#m-dcb7f290-ed68-4152-95fe-1d0b8e7c3310" label="lyrics-like">amótus fuero a villicatióne, recí¬</l><l xml:id="m-4fe06d9a-455d-475c-b650-ed4ad1348b6b" facs="#m-4fc34db7-cfc2-4be8-8920-fa3fd6e9acc8" label="lyrics-like">tátis: ut, cum defecéritis, recipiant</l><l xml:id="m-c73af9bc-47d7-4d7c-ba75-3c51d071d65f" facs="#m-3636a4ea-0f7d-4041-bac2-b278030630d1" label="lyrics-like">piant me in domos suas. Convocá¬</l><l xml:id="m-78d4d286-447d-46ec-b81a-4cab86c51f61" facs="#m-b93af87a-eff5-48a7-8b31-405dba0ae884" label="lyrics-like">vos in aetérna tabernácula.</l><l xml:id="m-327ef180-c984-4c63-8802-8ca7780737e0" facs="#m-c24766e7-f61f-4ca5-9d40-cb5d8ac5213e" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-d4433db6-ccb7-46a7-a310-2897e551b57a" facs="#m-65090780-b994-4cf6-905d-9339bb17d71d" label="lyrics-like">tis staque singulis debitóribus dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0eb08692-97a7-49ab-9cdf-04add8398206" facs="#m-99b11fe0-c659-4396-9e98-2162d4839c9f" label="lyrics-like">mini sui, dicébat primo: Quantum</l><l xml:id="m-f171dc55-db70-4246-91f0-eed664e9ce35" facs="#m-d6b2944d-f336-4ca4-9350-e2e5e19b4be7" label="ambiguous">orert.E</l><l xml:id="m-5168f93c-845a-4500-a82e-ae78340c2733" facs="#m-e9d062de-f7fa-4c31-8a04-bf2f6637ca28" label="lyrics-like"> O-pu- lum hú-mi- lem “sálvum fá- ci¬e</l><l xml:id="m-31732ed1-6ff4-4e86-a240-52ae386c6d5d" facs="#m-71084161-1c7d-4a23-87ad-a8d12e67290f" label="lyrics-like">Dó- mi-ne, et ó- cu- los superbó¬ rum humi-li¬</l><l xml:id="m-d159839d-9199-4ba0-842a-e8618f7f84ab" facs="#m-47d83c5e-8ed4-4311-bd49-03326f8fa0bb" label="lyrics-like">Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-0493ba2b-9a95-42fe-bbda-aabe553be999" facs="#m-685f4b31-17a8-4df2-b749-65ecebcf2ecb" label="lyrics-like">á¬</l><l xml:id="m-b64d05d5-9d3c-4fab-987e-f74132efa232" facs="#m-bf3101a0-a705-41aa-9ef4-616daa89281e" label="lyrics-like">bis: quóni-am quis</l><l xml:id="m-8785a48a-3e10-41e2-871a-756d6982b32f" facs="#m-33b3b684-c622-4671-b70f-0fbb7a6e0068" label="ambiguous">us praeter te,</l><l xml:id="m-299d4a87-36fe-4d84-992f-606abad550f9" facs="#m-6c8a50ba-c60f-45f3-ac12-73efe165fa44" label="lyrics-like">Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e1a969b6-5985-4bd6-a9ba-259cdfa1d219" facs="#m-ae7e7d48-60e1-473a-8f85-489e4e35ee3c" label="ambiguous">mi-ne?</l><l xml:id="m-543ab8bd-ca1f-44d0-8af3-8fd5a697510a" facs="#m-436064a7-f986-4c6c-b594-41a4e57ae866" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-51c35c73-df9e-48bc-afa9-81ed3e13224a" facs="#m-3569afe6-7dbb-441d-9791-0c66536cbb6f" label="lyrics-like">NUscipe, quaésumus Dómine, mú¬ tûte, et praeséntis vitae nos conver¬</l><l xml:id="m-b0970465-860e-4149-942d-6ffda8a77e28" facs="#m-3170ea45-e12b-4c66-9823-ad241a735cb2" label="lyrics-like">O nerà, quae tibi de tua largitáte satióne sanctíficent, et ad gáudia</l><l xml:id="m-6f8e17f5-d767-4e80-80eb-7a1f560b3a59" facs="#m-70895d5a-10c6-4670-979e-9cbd787def3b" label="lyrics-like">deférimus: ut haec sacrosáncta sempitérna perdúcant. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-45f0b8f2-a25b-4f96-8e55-83efb9a95bb4" facs="#m-00c94680-cf0b-49cd-9ffa-61bb86666fff" label="lyrics-like">mystéria, grátiae tuae operánte vir¬m.</l><l xml:id="m-886401ea-160d-498d-8aff-e87a98296e81" facs="#m-159ce45b-b83b-431a-9d44-7d7e48900456" label="lyrics-like">2. Exáudi nos. p. 501. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-e9ebfb93-987f-4cdd-804d-d83718d4217f" facs="#m-dd0f1d3c-40d2-42c1-8218-f23cc1353d83" label="ambiguous">Comm.E– =-----1si</l><l xml:id="m-4acc047e-c823-4200-a29b-3360892f6f49" facs="#m-6a83936c-a8c4-4074-a214-c2535c5b64e3" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-d89700c8-51a1-4fbf-a438-2f0776a45f92" facs="#m-a93463dc-105d-4471-9c82-19b0870d1d29" label="lyrics-like">Ustá-te“ et vidé- te. quó¬ ni¬</l><l xml:id="m-77fd6296-1659-404f-adac-23ae0ab5c2ec" facs="#m-42f6bade-61a8-4d95-b7b2-0372d7d1d7c0" label="lyrics-like">am su-á-vis</l></lg>
